---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Features">
	<section class="py-24 sm:py-32">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
				<h2 class="text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-ctp-mauve uppercase tracking-wider">Feature Tour</h2>
				<h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ctp-text sm:text-6xl">
					How decentcom works.
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-ctp-subtext1">
					A communication platform built on the principles of identity ownership and community sovereignty.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-24 space-y-24 sm:mt-32 sm:space-y-32">
				<!-- Detailed Feature 1 -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ctp-text">Identity is a Key, Not an Account</h3>
						<p class="mt-4 text-lg text-ctp-subtext1">
							In most chat services, your account exists as a row in the platform's database. 
							In decentcom, your account is an Ed25519 cryptographic key pair that *you* generate.
						</p>
						<ul class="mt-8 space-y-4">
							<li class="flex gap-x-3 text-ctp-subtext0">
								<span class="text-ctp-mauve font-bold">✓</span>
								No email, phone number, or personal info required.
							</li>
							<li class="flex gap-x-3 text-ctp-subtext0">
								<span class="text-ctp-mauve font-bold">✓</span>
								Use a 24-word recovery phrase to restore your identity anywhere.
							</li>
							<li class="flex gap-x-3 text-ctp-subtext0">
								<span class="text-ctp-mauve font-bold">✓</span>
								Your identity is portable across all servers you join.
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="rounded-2xl border border-ctp-surface1 bg-ctp-mantle p-8 shadow-2xl">
						<div class="aspect-video flex items-center justify-center text-8xl">🔑</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Detailed Feature 2 -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:flex-row-reverse">
					<div class="lg:order-last">
						<h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ctp-text">Privacy by Design</h3>
						<p class="mt-4 text-lg text-ctp-subtext1">
							Authentication is done via challenge-response signing. 
							Servers verify who you are without ever seeing a password or storing a secret.
						</p>
						<ul class="mt-8 space-y-4">
							<li class="flex gap-x-3 text-ctp-subtext0">
								<span class="text-ctp-mauve font-bold">✓</span>
								Private keys never leave your client's core process.
							</li>
							<li class="flex gap-x-3 text-ctp-subtext0">
								<span class="text-ctp-mauve font-bold">✓</span>
								No central operator logging your connections.
							</li>
							<li class="flex gap-x-3 text-ctp-subtext0">
								<span class="text-ctp-mauve font-bold">✓</span>
								You choose which servers to trust with your metadata.
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="rounded-2xl border border-ctp-surface1 bg-ctp-mantle p-8 shadow-2xl">
						<div class="aspect-video flex items-center justify-center text-8xl">🛡️</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Detailed Feature 3 -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-ctp-text">Community Sovereignty</h3>
						<p class="mt-4 text-lg text-ctp-subtext1">
							decentcom is designed for groups that want total control over their data and community.
						</p>
						<ul class="mt-8 space-y-4">
							<li class="flex gap-x-3 text-ctp-subtext0">
								<span class="text-ctp-mauve font-bold">✓</span>
								Self-host with a single binary or Docker container.
							</li>
							<li class="flex gap-x-3 text-ctp-subtext0">
								<span class="text-ctp-mauve font-bold">✓</span>
								Multiple membership modes: Open, Invite-only, or Allowlist.
							</li>
							<li class="flex gap-x-3 text-ctp-subtext0">
								<span class="text-ctp-mauve font-bold">✓</span>
								Full role-based permission system for granular control.
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="rounded-2xl border border-ctp-surface1 bg-ctp-mantle p-8 shadow-2xl">
						<div class="aspect-video flex items-center justify-center text-8xl">🏘️</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
